    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2015 Sweet, cute, and on the verge of breaking. This is a confinement horror born from \u201clove.\u201d \u2015</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending warm, gentle days with a bright and honest girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the morning, you cook breakfast together,<br>in the afternoon, you play games or nap on the sofa, <br>and at night, you fall asleep while watching a movie together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A \u201ccute life\u201d just like the ones people dream of. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/fce6717d4403da125616d899a581bb91.poster.avif?t=1746003879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/fce6717d4403da125616d899a581bb91.webm?t=1746003879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/fce6717d4403da125616d899a581bb91.mp4?t=1746003879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But slowly\u2026 you begin to notice it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something is wrong with this house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how many times you look, the view outside the window is always the same.<br>Your phone has no signal. <br>The calendar is stuck on \u201cMarch 17.\u201d <br>There\u2019s only one door\u2014and you can\u2019t leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The view outside is exactly the same, morning to night.<br>There is no front entrance\u2014only one door. <br>The phone is always out of service. <br>The calendar always says \u201cMarch 17.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then, with a smile, she says:<br>\u201cIt\u2019s just broken. Don\u2019t worry about it.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is this a dream? A prison? Or... love?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/e7475a66a386e5a8ebff98aae7d3c7ef.poster.avif?t=1746003879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/e7475a66a386e5a8ebff98aae7d3c7ef.webm?t=1746003879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you spend your days with her, <br>you may uncover the \u201csecret\u201d hidden inside this house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful.<br>If you get too close to the truth, <br><strong>she might be heartbroken.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nina\u2019s Sugar Cage is a psychological horror visual novel that follows the hidden truth beneath a \u201ccute and perfect\u201d everyday life. <br> <br>You play as a protagonist who has lost their memory, <br>and as you relive life with her,\u00a0 you\u2019ll gradually uncover the strangeness of the house and the truth sleeping inside her heart. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/74aebbbaf26a4abe5b7a9bb437da45b1.poster.avif?t=1746003879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/74aebbbaf26a4abe5b7a9bb437da45b1.webm?t=1746003879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Will you destroy this world\u2014 <br>or stay by her side in the illusion she created?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When all the truths are revealed, your choice will be put to the test.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2015 Sweet, cute, and on the verge of breaking. This is a confinement horror born from \u201clove.\u201d \u2015</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending warm, gentle days with a bright and honest girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the morning, you cook breakfast together,<br>in the afternoon, you play games or nap on the sofa, <br>and at night, you fall asleep while watching a movie together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A \u201ccute life\u201d just like the ones people dream of. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/fce6717d4403da125616d899a581bb91.poster.avif?t=1746003879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/fce6717d4403da125616d899a581bb91.webm?t=1746003879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/fce6717d4403da125616d899a581bb91.mp4?t=1746003879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But slowly\u2026 you begin to notice it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something is wrong with this house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how many times you look, the view outside the window is always the same.<br>Your phone has no signal. <br>The calendar is stuck on \u201cMarch 17.\u201d <br>There\u2019s only one door\u2014and you can\u2019t leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The view outside is exactly the same, morning to night.<br>There is no front entrance\u2014only one door. <br>The phone is always out of service. <br>The calendar always says \u201cMarch 17.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then, with a smile, she says:<br>\u201cIt\u2019s just broken. Don\u2019t worry about it.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is this a dream? A prison? Or... love?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/e7475a66a386e5a8ebff98aae7d3c7ef.poster.avif?t=1746003879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/e7475a66a386e5a8ebff98aae7d3c7ef.webm?t=1746003879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you spend your days with her, <br>you may uncover the \u201csecret\u201d hidden inside this house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful.<br>If you get too close to the truth, <br><strong>she might be heartbroken.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nina\u2019s Sugar Cage is a psychological horror visual novel that follows the hidden truth beneath a \u201ccute and perfect\u201d everyday life. <br> <br>You play as a protagonist who has lost their memory, <br>and as you relive life with her,\u00a0 you\u2019ll gradually uncover the strangeness of the house and the truth sleeping inside her heart. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/74aebbbaf26a4abe5b7a9bb437da45b1.poster.avif?t=1746003879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697140/extras/74aebbbaf26a4abe5b7a9bb437da45b1.webm?t=1746003879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Will you destroy this world\u2014 <br>or stay by her side in the illusion she created?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When all the truths are revealed, your choice will be put to the test.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Alone with your adorable girlfriend. A perfect home. A perfect routine. A perfect love. Sweet, happy, and flawless in every way. \u2026Except for one thing: you can\u2019t leave. A loop of love and madness\u2014 An exploration-based 3D psycho horror featuring a beautiful girl.",
